## Features

- **Adaptive AI Interviews** — Questions generated dynamically by Google Gemini 2.0 Flash, adapting in real time to the candidate's previous answers
- **Real-time Gesture Analysis** — Python/OpenCV backend analyzes webcam feed over WebSocket to score attention, eye contact, and posture
- **Voice Input** — Built-in Web Speech API integration for hands-free spoken answers
- **Code Editor** — Embedded Monaco editor with multi-language support (Python, JavaScript, C++, Java, Go) and live code execution via the Piston API
- **ATS Resume Checker** — Upload a PDF or Word resume and receive an ATS compatibility score with section-level feedback
- **Interview Pipeline Builder** — Drag-and-drop style editor to create multi-stage interview workflows (AI screening → deep interview → human round)
- **Proctoring** — Tab-switch detection with progressive warnings (3 strikes terminates the session)
- **Supabase Auth & Data** — Email/password authentication, user profiles, and interview history stored in Supabase
- **Dark Mode** — Full light/dark theme support via CSS variables and `next-themes`

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Frontend | React 18, TypeScript, Vite |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, Framer Motion |
| State / Data | TanStack Query, React Hook Form, Zod |
| Auth & DB | Supabase (PostgreSQL + Auth) |
| AI / LLM | Google Gemini 2.0 Flash (`generativelanguage` REST API) |
| Code Execution | Piston API (`emkc.org`) |
| Code Editor | Monaco Editor (`@monaco-editor/react`) |
| Vision Backend | Python, FastAPI, OpenCV, WebSocket |
| Routing | React Router v6 |
| Charts | Recharts |

