## Architecture Overview

```
Browser
  ├── React SPA (Vite)
  │     ├── Supabase JS SDK  ──────────► Supabase (Auth + PostgreSQL)
  │     ├── Gemini REST API  ──────────► Google AI (question gen / eval)
  │     ├── Piston REST API  ──────────► Code execution sandbox
  │     └── WebSocket client ──────────► Vision Service
  │
  └── Vision Service (FastAPI)
        └── OpenCV Haar Cascade (face detection + motion analysis)
```

